SUMMARY:The Four Principles
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nTopic:\n**The Four Princ
 iples -**\n**Atrium Group Ritual presented by Frank Nappi\, F.R.C.**\n\nAl
 l AMORC members\, their families and friends of the Rosicrucian Order are 
 welcome to attend. We are delighted to have you join us in ritual and disc
 ussion.\n\n• Important to know- Doors open for members and non-member fr
 iends of the Rosicrucian Order by 6:30 PM. Please arrive early! The Atrium
  Group ritual begins promptly at 7:00 PM. Members - please bring your cred
 entials or membership dues receipt.\n\nFollowing the meeting:\n1st Tuesday
 - Mystical Seekers Series Public Presentation at 8:00 PM\n\nThe Santa Rosa
  Pronaos operates under the law of AMRA. You may give as your heart and mi
 nd direct you.\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronaos is a 501c3 educational non-profit
 \, an affiliated body of the Rosicrucian English Grand Lodge for the Ameri
 cas and the Caribbean.
